# Terraform (terraform/, deploy/ecs/) — a real gap until the backlog
# Phase 7 infra round: terraform/bedrock-judge-panel and
# terraform/vector-s3-shipper never had this, and only avoided ever
# committing their own .terraform/ provider cache because nobody had run
# `terraform init` (without -backend=false's own separate CI-only path)
# in them locally before. .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored — that file
# is meant to be committed, per Terraform's own convention.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
tfplan
